#==============================================================================================
#
#   url - Fetch's URL scheme predicates
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/URL.h (lines 23-50) and URL.cpp
#       (lines 18-38): the HTTP(S) scheme test MIME sniffing needs (MimeSniff/Resource.cpp),
#       and local URLs and fetch schemes, which navigation needs (region r28: policy
#       containers in history, attempting to create a non-fetch scheme document). The rest of
#       the file (data: URL processing) is ported with Fetch in phase 2.
